<title>JAPAN: Masaru to buy back 100 mln yen worth of its shares.</title>
<headline>Masaru to buy back 100 mln yen worth of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Masaru Corp announced on Friday that it would buy back 150,000 of its shares, or 100 million yen worth.</p>
<p>The company, which does sealing work for condominiums and buildings, said in a statement that the share buy-back plan was decided at a company board meeting held earlier.</p>
